{
  "description": "Album (save slot) screen after GAME START, run by CDROM/EXEDIR/NAME_ENT.EXN: message-box prompts (0x197B4-0x1A14B). Lines starting with a full-width space keep a blank glyph ('  ') where an icon or number is drawn; '番アルバム' strings follow an album number drawn by the game, hence ': Album'. The Yes/No line keeps 'Yes...'/'No...' ending right before the cells where the circle/cross icons are drawn (cells 5 and 11). The buttons, slot numbers and info-panel labels are graphics.",
  "strings": [
    {
      "file": "CDROM/EXEDIR/NAME_ENT.EXN",
